    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a cool concept with the bioluminescence and the bone music. i like the idea of them being fundamentally different. \n\nto make them feel even more like a threat to the empire, can we get a bit more specific about their physical appearance and look? i want them to look more primal and maybe a bit \"lesser\" or more animalistic compared to the refined beauty of my protagonists. like, maybe they don't value hygiene or order the way the empire does? i want a description that really hammers home that they are a more savage, unrefined race.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
